meta {
  name: Post Create Fuel
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/fuel
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

body:multipart-form {
  vehicle_id: e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9
  fuel_volume: 20
  fuel_price_total: 300000
  fuel_brand: Shell
  fuel_type: Super
  fuel_ron: 92
  fuel_bill: @file()
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Post Create Fuel

  This request is used to create a fuel by using given `vehicle_id`, `fuel_volume`, `fuel_price_total`, `fuel_brand`, `fuel_type`, `fuel_ron`, and `fuel_bill` (Fuel Receipt image). This request interacts with the MySQL database, firebase storage, has a protected routes, and audited activity (history).

  ## Request Body (multipart/form-data)

  | Field            | Type    | Required | Description                        |
  |-------------------|---------|----------|--------------------------------------|
  | vehicle_id       | string  | yes      | Vehicle ID                          |
  | fuel_volume      | integer | yes      | Fuel volume                         |
  | fuel_price_total | integer | yes      | Total fuel price                    |
  | fuel_brand       | string  | yes      | Fuel brand (e.g. Shell)             |
  | fuel_type        | string  | no       | Fuel type (e.g. Super)              |
  | fuel_ron         | integer | no       | Fuel RON rating                     |
  | fuel_bill        | file    | no       | Fuel receipt image (binary upload)  |

  ## Responses

  **201 — fuel created**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "fuel created"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — fuel failed to created**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "fuel not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}